# The combo of a single Joy-Con: SL+SR, which SDL reports as the paddles
# paddle2 and paddle4 (a single Joy-Con is always held upright). Both are
# bound here, so the members of the combo hold keys: LCtrl and LShift go
# down, and the combo fires 2 s after the second, at 2300, which lets go of
# both and pauses. While paused, a tap of paddle2 maps nothing. Holding
# both again resumes at 6100; they were held across the resume, so their
# ups map nothing, and a new press of paddle2 holds LCtrl again.
# The Joy-Con is joycon-separate's.
